611f"},{"place_name":"渠丘","place_name_jianti_auto":"渠丘","start_index":70,"tongjian_id":"8cec0ed2-db0e-11ef-9c4a-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"陳","place_name_jianti_auto":"陈","start_index":78,"tongjian_id":"8cec0ed3-db0e-11ef-859f-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"蔡","place_name_jianti_auto":"蔡","start_index":80,"tongjian_id":"8cec0ed4-db0e-11ef-b87e-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"不羹","place_name_jianti_auto":"不羹","start_index":82,"tongjian_id":"8cec0ed5-db0e-11ef-9869-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"左傳：祭仲曰：「都城過百雉，國之害也。」辛伯曰：「大都耦國，亂之本也。」申無宇曰：「鄭京、櫟實殺曼伯，宋蕭、亳實殺子游，衞蒲、戚實出獻公，齊渠丘實殺無知，而陳、蔡、不羹亦殺楚靈王。」此皆大都危國也。傳，直戀翻。祭，則介翻。陸德明：櫟，音立；曼，音萬；羹，音郞。","note_content_jianti_auto":"左传：祭仲曰：「都城过百雉，国之害也。」辛伯曰：「大都耦国，乱之本也。」申无宇曰：「郑京、栎实杀曼伯，宋萧、亳实杀子游，衞蒲、戚实出献公，齐渠丘实杀无知，而陈、蔡、不羹亦杀楚灵王。」此皆大都危国也。传，直恋翻。祭，则介翻。陆德明：栎，音立；曼，音万；羹，音郞。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":223,"tongjian_id":"8cec0ec1-db0e-11ef-8f32-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"如下事之類。","note_content_jianti_auto":"如下事之类。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":231,"tongjian_id":"8cec0ed7-db0e-11ef-979c-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[{"relation_type":"back_reference","source_end_index":33,"source_start_index":19,"source_text":"淖齒弒齊湣王事見上卷三十一年","target_paragraph_tongjian_id":"8ca6883e-db0e-11ef-ae75-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"淖齒","people_name_jianti_auto":"淖齿","start_index":19,"tongjian_id":"8cec0ed9-db0e-11ef-9c0c-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"齊湣王","people_name_jianti_auto":"齐湣王","start_index":22,"tongjian_id":"8cec0eda-db0e-11ef-9291-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"管，掌也。擢，拔也。宿昔，一夕之間也。淖齒弒齊湣王事見上卷三十一年。淖，女敎翻。射，而亦翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"管，掌也。擢，拔也。宿昔，一夕之间也。淖齿弑齐湣王事见上卷三十一年。淖，女教翻。射，而亦翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":255,"tongjian_id":"8cec0ed8-db0e-11ef-83d6-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[{"relation_type":"back_reference","source_end_index":7,"source_start_index":0,"source_text":"事見上卷二十年","target_paragraph_tongjian_id":"8c9f1088-db0e-11ef-8049-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"事見上卷二十年。","note_content_jianti_auto":"事见上卷二十年。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":273,"tongjian_id":"8cec0edb-db0e-11ef-8ca4-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8cec0ede-db0e-11ef-b30b-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"秦","place_name_jianti_auto":"秦","start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"8cec0edf-db0e-11ef-b922-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"漢承秦制，鄕置有秩。漢官曰：鄕戶五千則置有秩，掌一鄕之入。風俗通曰：有秩則田間大夫，言其官裁有秩耳。大吏，謂左、右、中更以上爲吏者也。秩，直乙翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"汉承秦制，鄕置有秩。汉官曰：鄕户五千则置有秩，掌一鄕之入。风俗通曰：有秩则田间大夫，言其官裁有秩耳。大吏，谓左、右、中更以上为吏者也。秩，直乙翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":360,"tongjian_id":"8cec0edd-db0e-11ef-8e09-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"周武王","people_name_jianti_auto":"周武王","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"8cec0ee4-db0e-11ef-8d9e-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"應","place_name_jianti_auto":"应","place_note":"河南平顶山市西，白龟山水库内","start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"8cec0ee5-db0e-11ef-a8e0-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"唐","place_name_jianti